1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,459
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:08,019
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:18,300
Last time, the little prince fought with his rose and ran away.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:25,140
Today, he starts traveling across planets — who will he meet?

5
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:33,100
The little prince looked back one last time at his tiny planet. Then, he flew through the stars.

6
00:00:33,399 --> 00:00:37,379
First, he arrived at a planet full of houses.

7
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:41,259
A man sat on a tall chair, wearing a golden hat.

8
00:00:41,559 --> 00:00:45,619
I am the King! Everyone must obey my commands!

9
00:00:45,919 --> 00:00:47,419
The little prince asked.

10
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:50,979
Then can you command the sun to set? I want to see it now!

11
00:00:51,279 --> 00:00:58,219
Of course! But you'll have to wait... hmm... about 7:40 PM.

12
00:00:58,519 --> 00:01:01,619
The little prince waited a long time.

13
00:01:01,919 --> 00:01:05,099
The king finally commanded the sun to set.

14
00:01:05,399 --> 00:01:08,809
The little prince politely bowed and said goodbye.

15
00:01:09,109 --> 00:01:10,849
Then he kept flying forward.

16
00:01:11,149 --> 00:01:13,529
The second stop was a bigger planet.

17
00:01:13,829 --> 00:01:17,169
That man wore a big hat and a big coat.

18
00:01:17,469 --> 00:01:20,089
Ah! My admirer has come!

19
00:01:20,389 --> 00:01:22,849
The little prince asked curiously.

20
00:01:23,149 --> 00:01:24,569
What does "admire" mean?

21
00:01:24,869 --> 00:01:28,689
It means thinking I'm the handsomest and smartest person in the world!

22
00:01:28,989 --> 00:01:30,489
The vain man said.

23
00:01:30,789 --> 00:01:34,769
Clap your hands! When I hear clapping, I'll tip my hat!

24
00:01:35,069 --> 00:01:39,449
The little prince clapped. The vain man tipped his hat.

25
00:01:39,749 --> 00:01:43,329
A few minutes later, the little prince clapped again.

26
00:01:43,629 --> 00:01:45,449
The vain man tipped his hat again.

27
00:01:45,749 --> 00:01:49,649
But after a while, the little prince stopped clapping.

28
00:01:49,949 --> 00:01:52,089
The vain man felt very bored.

29
00:01:52,389 --> 00:01:54,929
The little prince continued his journey.

30
00:01:55,229 --> 00:01:58,009
On the third planet, there were many roses.

31
00:01:58,309 --> 00:02:02,449
The little prince saw so many roses and suddenly felt sad.

32
00:02:02,749 --> 00:02:05,449
I thought my rose was the only one in the universe...

33
00:02:05,749 --> 00:02:09,009
He sat on the ground and cried quietly.

34
00:02:09,309 --> 00:02:11,529
Then, a little fox appeared.

35
00:02:11,829 --> 00:02:12,449
Hello.

36
00:02:12,749 --> 00:02:14,569
Hello. Who are you?

37
00:02:14,869 --> 00:02:16,289
The fox said.

38
00:02:16,589 --> 00:02:21,769
I'm a fox. If you want to make friends, tame me.

39
00:02:22,069 --> 00:02:23,889
What does "tame" mean?

40
00:02:24,189 --> 00:02:25,609
The little prince asked.

41
00:02:25,909 --> 00:02:27,649
It means creating ties.

42
00:02:27,949 --> 00:02:30,649
If you tame me, we'll need each other.

43
00:02:30,949 --> 00:02:34,289
To me, you'll be the only one in the world.

44
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:37,930
To you, I'll be the only one in the world too.

45
00:02:38,230 --> 00:02:40,210
The little prince thought about it.

46
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:42,250
He thought about his rose.

47
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:44,690
Maybe my rose has already tamed me...

48
00:02:44,990 --> 00:02:47,930
The fox shared a secret with the little prince.

49
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:51,170
You can only see clearly with your heart.

50
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:54,650
What is truly essential is invisible to the eye.

51
00:02:54,950 --> 00:02:57,970
The little prince remembered those words.

52
00:02:58,270 --> 00:03:02,090
He said goodbye to the fox and kept flying.

53
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:05,730
He knew his rose was waiting for him to come back.

54
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:09,010
Kids, do you have a special friend?

55
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:12,170
Someone who "tamed" you.

56
00:03:12,470 --> 00:03:16,130
Go spend more time with them~

57
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:25,530
Next time, Qiqi and the little prince are going to a very bright planet.

58
00:03:25,830 --> 00:03:34,930
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

